    "outcome": {
      "ja": "Z=1,2の指定された束縛状態について、エネルギー・動径波動関数・格子収束を解析参照と比べる。",
      "en": "Compare energy, radial wavefunctions and grid refinement with analytic references for the specified Z=1,2 bound states."
    },
    "formula": {
      "role": "problem",
      "latex": [
        "\\left[-\\frac12\\frac{d^2}{dr^2}+\\frac{\\ell(\\ell+1)}{2r^2}-\\frac Zr\\right]u_{n\\ell}=E_{n\\ell}u_{n\\ell}",
        "E_n^{\\rm ref}=-\\frac{Z^2}{2n^2},\\qquad Z\\in\\{1,2\\}"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "原子単位の1電子・定常動径問題。計算は有限半径箱の零Dirichlet境界を使い、無限領域の水素型解析解と比較する。一般多電子・分子・周期系の解法を意味しない。",
        "en": "One-electron stationary radial problem in atomic units. A finite radial box with zero Dirichlet boundaries is compared with infinite-domain hydrogenic analytic references; not a general many-electron, molecular or periodic solver."
      }
    },
